encia, y Roberto y sus compañeros se encontrarán entre hordas de infectados y lealtades divididas.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1507696","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-16T11:40:49.382Z"},{"id":"movie-1777750","slug":"movie-1777750","title":"名探偵コナン 30号殺人事件","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pT9RIHf4K9OyOB3eqYj97E5h0YA.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Acción","Misterio","Crimen"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1777750","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-16T11:40:49.730Z"},{"id":"movie-1368314","slug":"movie-1368314","title":"El pasajero nocturno","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iX8D97TG8gVvHZ8S4clcdpCX7Uv.jpg","synopsis":"Después de presenciar un brutal accidente nocturno en la carretera, una joven pareja comprende que algo los ha seguido. Una presencia demoníaca, conocida como El Pasajero Nocturno, se ha unido a ellos y no se detendrá hasta reclamarlos a ambos, convirtiendo su viaje en una auténtica pesadilla.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1368314","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-16T11:40:50.076Z"},{"id":"movie-1442669","slug":"movie-1442669","title":"La Vénus électrique","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6mGCyYnuGpxGT3Wx4xuRMV20EEi.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1442669","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-16T11:40:50.422Z"},{"id":"movie-1234821","slug":"movie-1234821","title":"Jurassic World: El renacer","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2sbGd7kDhMicDkT097FR9a2JyGU.jpg","synopsis":"Cinco años después de los 